## Terms & Conditions

Birthday party terms and conditions at AeroSports Scarborough: Rescheduling is free and allowed up to 1 year from booking date. Cancellation with 14+ days notice receives a store gift card for the refund amount. Cancellation within 14 days receives no refund. Package changes must be made 14+ days in advance, subject to availability. Waivers are required for all jumpers (under 18 must be signed by parent/guardian, valid 1 year). Room supplies (plates, cups, tablecloths) are included. The jumping area is shared with other patrons but the party room is private. Prohibited items: no piñatas, confetti, or silly string ($40 cleaning charge if used). Advise of food allergies/sensitivities in advance. All guests should arrive 20 minutes early for check-in. AeroSports is not responsible for lost or stolen items.

[5] (source: birthday_parties.md)
## Premium Party

The Premium Party is $39.90 per jumper (minimum 10 jumpers, base price $399). Includes 75 minutes on the trampoline courts followed by 45 minutes in a private party room (fits 25-30 people). Food included: 1 large pizza per 5 jumpers and 1 juice box per jumper. The birthday child gets a FREE glow t-shirt, digital invitations, and a FREE 60-minute jump pass. All guest jumpers also receive a FREE 60-minute add-on pass. Go karting is NOT included but can be added on for $9.90 per person. No socks discount, no physical invitations, and outside food requires a $50 fee. Total party duration is approximately 2 hours (75 min jump + 45 min room).

